Package: codeart
Type: Package
Title: Generative Art from Noise Fields, Ribbons, Shards, Cubes and Wires
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Saikat", "Bandyopadhyay",
           email = "saikat.bandyopadhyay.dsx@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Renders high-resolution generative artworks in five styles:
    an extruded pin-field terrain, layered silk ribbons, Voronoi crystal
    shards, a wall of glossy rounded cubes and flowing wires draped over
    hills. Every style has a parameter constructor with plain-language
    settings, palette presets (shades of one colour or multi-colour
    palettes), a configurable aspect ratio, batch rendering and an optional
    watermark.
